name: Violet Vessel — massive blind
author: corpus
description: >-
  Violet Vessel is a very large blind (6x base). Ante 8 finisher: need extreme scaling or
  disable with Luchador/Chicot.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - boss: VioletVessel
    antes: [8]
should:
